cff-version: 1.2.0
title: TU/e BE Coding Café Knowledge Base
message: >-
  If you use this knowledge base in your teaching or your work,
  please cite it as below.
abstract: >-
  Notes, worked examples, and runnable code from the BE Coding Café sessions
  at the Department of the Built Environment, Eindhoven University of
  Technology. Covers version control, containers and cloud computing,
  databases and linked data, reproducible AI experiments, and making maps in
  code, written for researchers with no prior software experience assumed.
authors:
